          <center data-parsed="" style="min-width:0!important;width:100%">
            
            <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" class="container float-center" style="Margin:0 auto;background:#fefefe;border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;float:none;margin:0 auto;padding:0;text-align:center;vertical-align:top;width:670px"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><td style="-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word"><!-- START Header Modules --> <!-- START Preheader | Version 3.2 --><p class="text-center" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:center;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">매니아 PC 전문가로서 비즈니스를 확장할 수 있는 새로운 기회를 맞이해 보십시오. 앞으로 더욱 심도 깊은 업무 협력 관계를 맺을 수 있기를 기대하겠습니다.<br><a href="http://app.plan.intel.com/e/es?s=~~eloqua..type--emailfield..syntax--siteid..encodeFor--url~~&amp;e=~~eloqua..type--emailfield..syntax--elqemailsaveguid..encodeFor--url~~" target="_blank" style="Margin:inherit;color:#00AEEF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:23.4px;margin:inherit;padding:0;text-align:left;text-decoration:none">본 이메일을 웹 페이지로 보려면 여기를 클릭하십시오</a></p><!-- END Preheader | Version 3.2 --> <!-- START Header - Basic Image Bottom Text CTA | Version 3.2 --><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="row header" style="background-color:#0071c5;border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;display:table;padding:0;position:relative;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">
