                        </div><!-- START Header Content --><h1 class="text-center" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:5px;color:#fefefe;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:32px;margin:0;margin-bottom:5px;padding:0;text-align:center;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">자격이 충족되셨습니다.</h1><!-- START Text CTA --><h3 class="text-center" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:5px;color:#0071c5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:23.4px;margin:0;margin-bottom:5px;padding:0;text-align:center;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/kr/ko/secure/technology-provider/enthusiast-qualified/qualified-enthusiast-pc-specialty-benefits.html" target="_blank" style="Margin:0;color:#8CDAFA;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:23.4px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;text-decoration:none">혜택 이용 &gt;</a></h3><!-- START Text CTA --> <!-- END Header Content --></th>
