                </tr></tbody></table><!-- START Header Image --> <img src="http://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{4913b410-1328-4089-95a4-b0af78b55f99}_C-MKA-333_T-MKA-1698-hero-4.jpg" alt="" class="responsive" style="-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;clear:both;display:block;max-width:100%;outline:0;text-decoration:none;width:auto"> <!-- END Header Image --> <!-- END Header - Basic: Image Bottom Text CTA | Version 3.2 --> <!-- START Spacer Module | Version 3.2 --><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="spacer" style="border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><td height="30px" style="-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:30px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:30px;margin:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><!-- END Spacer Module --> <!-- END Header Modules --> <!-- START Body Modules --> <!-- START Content Full Width | Version 3.2 --><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="row body" style="Margin:0;background:#fefefe;border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;color:#959595;display:table;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;height:100%;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">
                    <th class="content no-padding-bottom small-12 large-12 columns first last" style="Margin:0 auto;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:24.5px;margin:0 auto;padding:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:30px;padding-right:30px;text-align:left;width:640px"><table style="border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><th style="Margin:0;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left"><!-- START Content --><h2 style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:5px;color:#0071c5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:23.4px;margin:0;margin-bottom:5px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none"><span class="eloquaemail">FirstName</span>님,</h2>
                       
                        <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">인텔<sup>&reg;</sup> 기술 공급자 매니아 PC 전문가가 되신 것을 축하 드립니다.<p>
                                <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">전 세계 10만명 이상의 PC 게이머<sup>1</sup>와 이 빠르게 성장하는 시장에서, 인텔과 함께 고객 기반을 성장시키고 더 많은 수익을 창출할 수 있도록 자리 잡아 보십시오.</p>
                                <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">이제 다음과 같이 제공되는 모든 혜택을 누리실 수 있습니다.</p>
                        
                        <ul>
                          <li>인텔<sup>&reg;</sup> 코어&trade; X-, K-, H-시리즈 프로세서가 탑재된 제품 판매 시 추가 포인트 프로모션 이용</li>
                          <li>인텔 기술 공급자 웹 페이지에 매니아 PC 전문 판매자로 표시되어 홍보 효과 상승</li>
                          <li>인텔 전문가들이 진행하는 기술 웨비나</li>
                          <li>수준 높은 게임/소프트웨어 팩</li>
                          <li>현지 e스포츠 행사 입장권</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">인텔과 함께 해 주셔서 감사합니다.</p><!-- START Button CTA --><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="button radius no-margin-bottom small-expanded" style="Margin:0 0 30px 0;border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;margin:0 0 30px 0;margin-bottom:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:auto"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><td style="-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word"><table style="border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">
<td style="-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;background:#00AEEF;border:none;border-collapse:collapse!important;border-radius:3px;color:#fefefe;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/kr/ko/secure/technology-provider/enthusiast-qualified/qualified-enthusiast-pc-specialty-benefits.html" target="_blank" style="Margin:0;border:0 solid #00AEEF;border-radius:3px;color:#fefefe;display:inline-block;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:23.4px;margin:0;padding:8px 30px 8px 30px;text-align:left;text-decoration:none">혜택 이용</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!-- END Button CTA --> <!-- END Content --></th>
